          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"wb-sweep-analysis\">W&amp;B Sweep Analysis</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Load sweep runs into a dataframe, save to CSV, and explore results.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Notes</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>You can load runs locally from the <code>wandb/</code> directory without any API access.</li>\n<li>To use the W&amp;B API, uncheck \"Use local wandb/ directory\" and set the sweep path.</li>\n<li>The sweep path looks like: <code>entity/project/sweep_id</code>.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
